        <mxCell id="boundary_note" parent="1" vertex="1" style="text;html=1;align=center;fontSize=11;fontStyle=2;fontColor=#A32C7C;" value="SANCTUM IS STAGES 1–3.  Stage 3 has two halves: 3a mechanical (Arbites scores and ranks) and 3b linguistic (select · summarise · caveat · section).  Its output is THE VOX — a refined staging document, not an intelligence product.">
