        <mxCell id="leg_row_color" parent="1" vertex="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;" value="&lt;b&gt;Cell colors&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;• White border = Inputs / Outputs (data through the stage)&#xa;• Amber = Touchpoint — where YOU adjust this stage&#xa;• Grey = Technologies supporting the stage&#xa;• Purple = FILES — repo paths that play this role (&lt;domain&gt; = cti, …)&#xa;• Header blue = cycle stage · purple header = feedback">
          <mxGeometry x="80" y="841" width="660" height="110" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <!-- STATUS POINTER -->
        <mxCell id="status_note" parent="1" vertex="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FAFAF7;strokeColor=#5F5E5A;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=8;" value="Where per-domain status lives (this map stays domain-neutral)">
          <mxGeometry x="800" y="806" width="1390" height="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="status_body" parent="1" vertex="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;" value="This diagram shows the cycle + file roles ONLY — it does not change per domain. Anything that DOES vary per domain lives in text, one place each:&#xa;&#xa;• &lt;domain&gt;/mandate.md — Standing Directives, PENDING DIRECTION (backlog), and the dated LESSONS log = the live tracker for that effort.&#xa;• logs/CHANGELOG.md — curated history across the whole apparatus.&#xa;• &lt;domain&gt;/pnd.md — the actual config (feeds, weights, sections) currently in force.&#xa;&#xa;To add a domain: create &lt;newdomain&gt;/pnd.md (+ codex.md, mandate.md) and run  run.sh &lt;newdomain&gt;. This cycle applies unchanged.">
          <mxGeometry x="820" y="841" width="1350" height="110" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <!-- CROSS-CUTTING FILES -->
        <mxCell id="crosscut" parent="1" vertex="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EDE7F6;strokeColor=#5E35B1;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;Cross-cutting (all domains / repo scaffolding):&lt;/b&gt;  README.md · ROADMAP.md · VERSIONING.md · requirements.txt · run.sh · .gitignore · core/__init__.py · diagrams/sanctum-topology.drawio · diagrams/cogitator.drawio (this map)">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="971" width="2130" height="40" as="geometry" />
